# The image builds from an allowlist: everything else in the checkout stays out
# of the build context, including local data, keys, installers and models.
*

!Dockerfile
!LICENSE
!LICENSING.md
!LICENSES/
!assets/branding/
!contracts/examples/
!docker/
!convo/
!core/
!apps/privacy-worker/
!apps/desktop/

# Built and staged by the image itself.
core/bin/
core/coverage.out
core/internal/console/webui/*
!core/internal/console/webui/placeholder.html
apps/desktop/dist/
apps/desktop/dist-web/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/binaries/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target-dmg/

# Dependencies, build output and tooling caches.
**/node_modules/
**/target/
**/.venv/
**/.git/
**/.DS_Store

# Test models and anything that looks like a secret or local data.
apps/privacy-worker/testdata/
apps/privacy-worker/scripts/
**/*.onnx
**/*.onnx_data*
**/*.onnx.data
**/*.safetensors
**/*.gguf
**/*.ggml
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.dmg
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
